.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK AGENT SKILL CHECK"
.SH NAME
hamstik agent skill check \- Validate an Agent Skill against this binary's command surface and compatibility metadata. Defaults to the installed skill; an explicit PATH validates any skill file (this is what CI runs)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik agent skill check [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Validate an Agent Skill against this binary's command surface and compatibility metadata. Defaults to the installed skill; an explicit PATH validates any skill file (this is what CI runs)
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I PATH
Explicit path to a `SKILL.md` to validate instead of the default installed-location lookup
